    <dct:title xml:lang="bg-t-en-t0-mtec">AVHRR - Температура на земната повърхност (LST) - Европа, Нощно време</dct:title>
    <prov:qualifiedAttribution>
      <prov:Attribution>
        <prov:agent>
          <foaf:Organization>
            <foaf:mbox rdf:resource="mailto:geoservice@dlr.de"/>
            <locn:address>
              <locn:Address/>
            </locn:address>
